      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠰᠣᠬᠲᠣᠭᠣᠷᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>soqdoγuraqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>согтуурах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>SOΓTUΓURA-</transcript>
      <definition>[= soγtaγura-] v. i. To begin to be intoxicated, get drunk; to feel tipsy; to be infatuated, obscured, dizzy.</definition>
      <page>723</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠢ ᠰᠣᠬᠲᠣᠭᠣᠷᠠᠵᠤ ᠪᠠᠶᠢᠨ᠎ᠠ ᠣᠳᠤ ᠤᠭᠤᠵᠤ ᠴᠢᠳᠠᠬᠤ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>bi --zu bain-a, odu uγuzu cidaxu ygei</transcript>
          <definition> I am beginning to feel tipsy, l cannot drink any more</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
